---
/**
 * Where the artwork comes from. The deck is described rather than named:
 * the artwork is public domain, but the familiar two-word deck name is a
 * live trademark.
 */
---

<footer class="site-footer shell">
    <p>
        Card images from the classic 1909 deck illustrated by Pamela Colman
        Smith, in the public domain.
    </p>
</footer>

<style>
    .site-footer {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        padding-block: 2rem 3rem;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .site-footer p {
        margin-inline: auto;
        max-width: 34rem;
        font-family: var(--font-label);
        font-size: 0.66rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.07em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-muted);
    }
</style>
